      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name} that's not very helpful as already stated there is no alternative but using animators as of now - so we need to use even more jank solutions that require even more workarounds (that are bad for performance) I see no harm in exposing more till there is an actual solution from vrc side.",
