      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name} my hope is that one of those alternatives could be an avatar udon/u#/soba system that can run locally on player's avatars, and if you wanna have it sync on the network that could be synced similarly to how the avatar parameter list works. It'd have more bits compared to the current avatar parameter list of 256-bits but it'd only be for the new system, while the current limit would be for animators",
