      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name} Unless you guys plan on redoing the entire avatar system within the same amount of time it would take to just expose more parameters, I think you’re going about this all the wrong way. You didn’t stop adding things to Udon just because you are working on Soba in the bg, why do that here? Remember the old adage: “Perfect is the enemy of good”.",
